[{"type": "text", "x": 30, "y": 18, "text": "Relative estimation : เทียบขนาดกับเรื่องอ้างอิง ไม่ใช่นับชั่วโมง", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "strokeColor": "#0b2545"}, {"type": "rectangle", "x": 30, "y": 75, "width": 260, "height": 508, "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5", "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0}, {"type": "text", "x": 45, "y": 85, "text": "แบบเดิม : ประเมินเป็นชั่วโมง", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "strokeColor": "#c92a2a"}, {"type": "text", "x": 45, "y": 112, "text": "เรื่องเดียวกัน ถามคนละคน", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f"}, {"id": "h1", "type": "rectangle", "x": 55, "y": 145, "width": 210, "height": 50, "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 16, "text": "คนที่ 1  →  8h ?"}, {"id": "h2", "type": "rectangle", "x": 55, "y": 210, "width": 210, "height": 50, "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 16, "text": "คนที่ 2  →  12h ?"}, {"id": "h3", "type": "rectangle", "x": 55, "y": 275, "width": 210, "height": 50, "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 16, "text": "คนที่ 3  →  30h ?"}, {"type": "line", "x": 45, "y": 135, "points": [[0, 0], [230, 200]], "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "strokeWidth": 4, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 45}, {"type": "line", "x": 275, "y": 135, "points": [[0, 0], [-230, 200]], "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "strokeWidth": 4, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 45}, {"type": "text", "x": 45, "y": 365, "text": "คนต่างกัน เวลาต่างกัน", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "strokeColor": "#c92a2a"}, {"type": "text", "x": 45, "y": 395, "text": "8h ของใคร? เร็วหรือช้า?\nตัวเลขชั่วโมงกลายเป็น\n\"คำสัญญา\" ที่ถูกทวง", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f"}, {"type": "text", "x": 45, "y": 480, "text": "→ เลิกถาม \"กี่ชั่วโมง\"\n   ถาม \"ใหญ่กว่าเรื่องอ้างอิงกี่เท่า\"", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "strokeColor": "#16212f"}, {"type": "text", "x": 320, "y": 85, "text": "เทียบกับเรื่องอ้างอิง (reference story)", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "strokeColor": "#2f9e44"}, {"type": "text", "x": 320, "y": 118, "text": "1) เลือกเรื่องกลาง ๆ ที่ทุกคนเข้าใจดี → 2 pt\n2) เรื่องอื่นเทียบกับเรื่องนี้\n3) เลือกตัวเลขที่ใกล้สุดจาก 1 2 3 5 8 13", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "strokeColor": "#16212f"}, {"id": "ref", "type": "rectangle", "x": 320, "y": 255, "width": 200, "height": 100, "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 16, "text": "เรื่องอ้างอิง\nเข้าสู่ระบบด้วยอีเมล\n= 2 pt"}, {"type": "text", "x": 320, "y": 380, "text": "ทุกเรื่องถามคำถามเดียว :\n\"เล็กหรือใหญ่กว่าเรื่องนี้กี่เท่า\"", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f"}, {"id": "s1", "type": "rectangle", "x": 645, "y": 113, "width": 170, "height": 60, "backgroundColor": "#d0ebff", "strokeColor": "#1864ab", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 14, "text": "ปุ่มลืมรหัสผ่าน\n= 1 pt"}, {"id": "s5", "type": "rectangle", "x": 645, "y": 255, "width": 230, "height": 90, "backgroundColor": "#ffe8cc", "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 15, "text": "รีเซ็ตรหัสผ่านทางอีเมล\n= 5 pt"}, {"id": "s13", "type": "rectangle", "x": 645, "y": 425, "width": 245, "height": 115, "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3", "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 13, "text": "ล็อกอินด้วย Google/OAuth\n= 13 pt\nใหญ่เกินไป → ควรแตก", 